  "title": "Seared Ahi Tuna with Apple-Ginger Soy Sauce",
  "description": "Pair seared ahi tuna steaks with a simple sauce of apple, ginger, soy sauce, and honey for a quick and easy dinner that's ready in less than 30 minutes.",
